/*!
    \page embedded-catalog.html
    \title Embedded Catalog
    \brief Catalog directives embedded inside section blocks.

    This page wraps catalog directives in section blocks. The
    template generator's section dispatch must recurse correctly so
    every embedded catalog renders as a populated table or list.

    \section1 Group Members in Section

    Surrounding prose appears before the catalog directive so the
    section block carries multiple children, with the catalog as
    one of them.

    \annotatedlist catalog_members_group

    Trailing prose verifies that content after the catalog still
    renders normally, anchoring the catalog as a non-terminal child
    of the section block.

    \section1 Compact Classes in Section

    A second section confirms that adjacent sections each receive
    their own catalog dispatch.

    \generatelist classes Beta
*/
